  "version": 1,
  "note": "3D assets the 3D Model Manager offers for download. Nothing here is bundled: each file is fetched on request, pinned to one commit of its source, and kept only if its length and SHA-256 match. extent is the model length, in file units, that size.meters is matched to (its largest bounding-box side unless size.note names another), measured by loading it in Studio; metersPerUnit is size.meters / extent. Numbers in size come from the quoted page; a null size means none was checked.",
