      "commit": "11ebb4ee043715aefbba6aeec8a61746fad67fa7",
      "terms": "The repository README says these assets are \"free and without copyright\" and points to NASA's usage guidelines; its meta.json lists the NASA Open Source Agreement 1.3. NASA's guidelines ask for credit to NASA, do not allow the insignia or logos to imply endorsement, and leave any third-party material its own copyright.",
      "terms_source": [
        "https://github.com/nasa/NASA-3D-Resources/blob/11ebb4ee043715aefbba6aeec8a61746fad67fa7/README.md",
        "https://github.com/nasa/NASA-3D-Resources/blob/11ebb4ee043715aefbba6aeec8a61746fad67fa7/meta.json",
        "https://www.nasa.gov/nasa-brand-center/images-and-media"
      ]
    }
